<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\wave1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "700" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館家族風呂夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Natsumi's<STYLE ID="1"> parents had started partying, so </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> and I decided to use the family bath, just the two of us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With this view and this water, I was in the best mood.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But for a while now, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> had been deigning to say baffling things about checks and passing.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, sorry. It's such a special chance, and it's just <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE> and Mom getting all worked up..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's fine, it's fine! Doing what you enjoy is what matters most!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Nobody has to go out of their way to be considerate of me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> words came back to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Rather than straining to be considerate of each other, enjoying this time is what matters most.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's the best thanks I can give </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Is the sun starting to go down a little?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In another hour or two, we'd probably get to see a beautiful sunset.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Faint voices could be heard from around us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed there were groups enjoying the family baths in other rooms too.</STYLE><PG>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
............!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> was staring hard at me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, her gaze seemed to be aimed a little lower...</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
"Hey, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, we're sisters, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Why bring that up now..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考える風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Even though we're sisters... 
{PAUSE ""}
what's with this difference?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\天然ボケにご用心.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> seemed to have been staring holes into my upper body.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Qu-qu-quit staring so much...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">I got embarrassed and sank into the water up to my mouth.</STYLE><PG>
"We're sisters, so why didn't we turn out alike in this part!?
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>! Aren't you getting some good supplements from <STYLE ID="5">Obasan</STYLE> or something!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A-are you stupid!? I'm not doing anything!"</STYLE><PG>
"Then what's this difference!?
{PAUSE ""}
　You took all the nutrients in <STYLE ID="6">Mom's</STYLE> belly with you when you were born, didn't you!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"How should I know, idiot! It's not like there's anything good about it!"</STYLE><PG>
"People who've had them from the start don't get it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For some reason, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> ended up blaming me...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'd think there's nothing anyone can do about this one, though.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then, the sound of the family bath's door opening.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\lcm\能面隠し.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "1000" "307" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n750\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n790\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n750\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n790\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, daughters of mine! How's the family bath?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"H-h-hold on...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had barged in, naked as the day he was born.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Swaying on his feet, he seemed pretty drunk.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔前逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Come on, <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>... I'm always telling you, no getting in the bath after you've been drinking."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"!!??"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> wasn't even fazed!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Unlike </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">, my head had gone into total panic.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">ah..."</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7"><TXSPS>"Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeek!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>For the first time in my life, I let out a pretty, girly scream.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n500\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n540\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n500\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n540\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Wh-what!? What's wrong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"What's wrong, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No no no, wait wait wait wait wait!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Do these two not think this situation is weird!?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Then I heard voices from the family bath of another room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Did you just hear a huge scream?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Could it be a groper?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"What!? There are gropers at this inn!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n700\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n740\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n700\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n740\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hrrm! If anyone does anything to my daughters, I won't forgive them!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔前逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>, you're so cool!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, no, the least forgivable one here is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">this naked old man</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and he's the least cool, too!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I mean, don't come in here!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I mean, cover yourself up!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I mean, this is unbelievable!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hurled every bath </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おけ">bucket</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> within reach at the </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">naked old man</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n400\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n440\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n400\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n440\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Whoa, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n800\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n840\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n800\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n840\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">　What's wrong!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n600\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n640\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n600\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n640\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Calm down!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n960\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n960\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Hey, that's dangerous!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why would a man come in while women are in here!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Peeper! Pervert! Groper!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When I'd said that much, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> slunk back out, looking lonely.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Good thing I'd been sitting deep in the tub...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You scared me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"What's wrong, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="2">, doesn't this bother you at all!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　A man barged in on us!? A man's seeing us naked!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? But we're family."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Could it be that </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> still takes baths with her </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, well, I've heard there are parents and kids like that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So the Kogori family has that culture too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Here, I had no choice but to force myself to accept it.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考える風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"???"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> is a bit of a daddy's girl, but I never imagined they were still bathing together at her age.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There's still so much I don't know.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm never getting in with him, no matter what!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Not even if </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">he's my own father by blood</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I mean, the only one who still bathes with her dad at this age is you, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No way!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Even though it's family!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Everyone else is different!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Obviously!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Still, for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> it was the obvious thing, and he probably meant no harm at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe I was a little mean... Should I apologize when we get back to the room?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So becoming a family is hard...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But I'd let out a tremendous scream just now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hope it doesn't turn into a big deal, with the police showing up or anything...</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">But that hope of mine was in vain―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\探偵推理中.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
